<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Simple Capture third-party notices</title>
<style>
body { font: 14px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party notices</h1>
<p>Rust crates compiled into Simple Capture. Native code inside crates (Skia, FreeType, HarfBuzz, ICU and others) and the bundled helpers are listed separately (docs/LICENSES.md §2.4, §3).</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>Licenses</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
